This directory vendors the MaxMind DB Reader for PHP.

  Project: maxmind-db/reader (MaxMind-DB-Reader-php)
  Source:  https://github.com/maxmind/MaxMind-DB-Reader-php
  License: Apache-2.0 (see ./LICENSE)

Only the pure-PHP reader is bundled (no C extension required). It is used to
read DB-IP / MaxMind .mmdb databases for IP geolocation. No MaxMind data is
included; the GeoIP database is downloaded separately from DB-IP at runtime.
